At minimum enforce:

- all referenced atoms exist
- no invalid bonds
- valence remains valid
- supported reaction has the correct reactant/product relationship
- conserved atoms remain consistent where applicable
- bond changes match the declared reaction
- unsupported reaction combinations are rejected

Implement deterministic reaction signatures / transformation matching.

